                                   <div id="feature-bullets" class="a-section a-spacing-medium a-spacing-top-small">                    <div id="featureBulletsSeeMoreExpander" data-a-expander-collapsed-height="156" class="a-expander-collapsed-height a-row a-expander-container a-spacing-none a-expander-partial-collapse-container" style="max-height: none; height: 156px;"> <div data-expanded="false" class="a-expander-content a-expander-partial-collapse-content" style="padding-bottom: 24px;"> <hr aria-hidden="true" class="a-divider-normal">    <h2 class="a-size-base-plus a-text-bold"> About this item </h2>                  <ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini">  <li class="a-spacing-mini"><span class="a-list-item"> Bird Spike : 305 mm length, Height 95 mm, width 120 mm  </span></li>  <li class="a-spacing-mini"><span class="a-list-item"> Protect your AC, Ledges, Window Sil, Balcony Area, Warehouse, Factory, Office and Premises with Bird Control Spike  </span></li>  <li class="a-spacing-mini"><span class="a-list-item"> Easy to install: They are easy to install and can be easily fixed to the top or edge of fence or climb mesh with cable ties, adhesive, nails, or screws.  </span></li>  <li class="a-spacing-mini"><span class="a-list-item"> Premium materials: The bird spikes are made of polypropylene plastic, which is lightweight. It can also resist changing weather conditions and long-term UV radiation and is not prone to aging, decomposition, rusting, and is very durable, making it ideal for fence tops in the garden use.  </span></li>  <li class="a-spacing-mini"><span class="a-list-item"> Humanized Design: Plastic bird spike is a humane bird control and anti cat climb option because they do not harm birds, but rather discourage them from landing on surfaces where the spikes are installed.  </span></li>  </ul>            <div data-csa-c-content-id="voyager-product-details-jumplink" data-csa-c-slot-id="voyager-product-details-jumplink" data-csa-c-type="link" 