                   <div class="aplus-module-wrapper apm-fixed-width">
   <div class="apm-spacing">
        <div class="apm-lefttwothirdswrap apm-floatleft">
            <div class="apm-leftimage">
                                                        <img alt="Bird Spikes" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/91c23e47-db80-4353-91fa-139e5032c958.__CR0,0,1024,1024_PT0_SX300_V1___.png" class="a-spacing-mini" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/91c23e47-db80-4353-91fa-139e5032c958.__CR0,0,1024,1024_PT0_SX300_V1___.png"><noscript><img alt="Bird Spikes" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/91c23e47-db80-4353-91fa-139e5032c958.__CR0,0,1024,1024_PT0_SX300_V1___.png"/></noscript>  </div>
            <div class="apm-centerthirdcol">
                                                       <h3 class="a-spacing-mini"> Eco-Friendly Bird Protection Without Chemicals </h3>                                          <h4 class="a-spacing-mini a-color-secondary"> Safe for Birds, Safe for Your Home </h4>                                    <p class="a-spacing-base"> Protect your space in a natural and responsible way without using harmful chemicals or toxins. These bird spikes offer a humane solution that simply prevents birds from landing, without causing injury. Ideal for homes, offices, and commercial areas, they ensure a clean and hygienic environment. Made from non-toxic, durable materials, they are safe for both humans and pets. Choose a sustainable bird control method that works effectively while caring for nature. </p>                                                                                                                                      </div>
        </div>

