ded k-observe k-expand-let=shouldStopPropa_34_5 k-parent=92eba9c5-02d7-4764-a153-bf913339a67c k-data=[omitted] k-init--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-expand-let=viewTypeStr_43_5 k-parent=92eba9c5-02d7-4764-a153-bf913339a67c k-data=[omitted] k-init--><div data-testid="ratings-histogram-explanation-content" style="" class="aui-primitive __HcW37uFAv __HcWIi-82IiB1 __HcWIi-bS7X-z" k-observe="" k-use="92eba9c5-02d7-4764-a153-bf913339a67c" k-style="inlineStyles_271_5" k-class="mergedStyles_272_5" onclick="" k-init="" k-bound=""><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ __SAR2l0N01yuZ __P0nNOOvptgdu">Customer Reviews, including Product Star Ratings help customers learn more about the product and decide whether it is the right product for them.</span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ __SAR2l0N01yuZ __P0nNOOvptgdu">To calculate the overall star rating and percentage breakdown by star, we don’t use a simple average. Instead, our system considers things like how recent a review is and if the reviewer bought the item on Amazon. It also analysed reviews to verify trustworthiness.</span><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-component=TextLink-CW5gFkCpvCIYQQ2 k-id=1831b132-c700-4377-86af-11c4a341184a k-data=[omitted] k-init k-ready--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-var-addr=/ExplanationExpa_157_21/TextLink_helpLi_67_9/mouseHover_37_11 k-expand-let=mouseHover_37_11 k-parent=1831b132-c700-4377-86af-11c4a341184a k-data=[omitted] k-init--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-expand-let=hoverStyles_62_5 k-parent=1831b132-c700-4377-86af-11c4a341184a k-data=[omitted] k-init--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-component=TextLink-ankhSKrqAwy000u k-id=d30d598b-b287-48a3-8b72-9721ed616797 k-composed=TextLinkPrimiti_111_1 k-parent=1831b132-c700-4377-86af-11c4a341184a k-data=[omitted] k-init k-ready--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-expand-let=shouldStopPropa_50_5 k-parent=d30d598b-b287-48a3-8b72-972