88c13eb89 k-data=[omitted] k-closure-key=renderingProps__245_139 k-closure-holder=705b29e7-40a4-443a-93f5-4c725c9bd0f3 k-init-->Customers find the bird spikes effective at preventing pigeon entry and keeping them away from windows and balconies. The product is easy to install and customers consider it worth the price. While some customers find the spikes sturdy and durable, others report durability issues, with one customer noting that the plastic starts to disintegrate after two years.<!-- k-injected k-component-close --></span><!-- k-injected k-component-close --><!-- k-injected k-component-close --><!-- k-injected k-component-close --><!-- k-injected k-component-close --></div><!-- k-injected k-component-close --><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-component=SharedContent-LrtdIZRgXZS0IHd k-id=1431a8db-2ded-4589-b316-b35c01a5205e k-data=[omitted] k-closure-key=aspectClickEven_571_13 k-closure-holder=ed1f46f7-c078-4a11-b963-f1e867231b8f k-init k-ready--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-component=ExperimentalShow-uB6hcyU5SZnx_gP k-id=8e2e8dd1-f141-404d-b2a0-808d9a0a7347 k-composed=ExperimentalSho_276_5 k-parent=1431a8db-2ded-4589-b316-b35c01a5205e k-data=[omitted] k-init k-ready--><div class="aui-primitive __HcW37uIi- __HcWIi-82IiB1 __HcWIi-bS7X-z" style="" k-observe="" k-use="8e2e8dd1-f141-404d-b2a0-808d9a0a7347" k-class="condition_style_50_3" k-style="inlineStyles_51_3" k-init="" k-bound=""><div data-testid="ai-disclaimer" style="" class="aui-primitive __HcW37uIi- __HcWIi-82IY0d __P0nNOOvptwIJ __HcWz_SzO0"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __HcWWkUdHN __HcWNg-FAv __3LVrZoFAv">AI Generated from the text of customer reviews</span><img src="./bird-spikes1_files/sfwfCa9XX12F4At.png" k-metric-loaded-enabled="false" aria-hidden="true" style="display:inline-block;height:18px;width:18px;object-fit:cover;" class="aui-primitive __P0nNOOKHIa4a __P0nNOONh5Qzh __HcWIi-bS7X-z"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" aria-hidden="true" class="aui-prim