ic-loaded-enabled="false" aria-hidden="true" style="display:inline-block;height:12px;width:12px;object-fit:cover;" class="aui-primitive __HcWIi-bS7X-z"></button><!-- k-injected k-component-close --><!-- k-injected k-component-close --></div><span style="white-space: pre-line;" data-testid="aspect-summary" class="aui-primitive __P0nNOOvpt01x __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">Customers have mixed opinions about the sharpness of the bird spikes, with some finding them satisfactory while others report they are not very sharp.</span><div style="" class="aui-primitive __HcW37uIi- __HcWIi-82IiB1 __HcWIi-bS7X-z __P0nNOOKHIwIJ"><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-component=SnippetList-OJ5UVzil843ddaK k-id=e980727c-4dfd-4a86-88ef-565df510bca0 k-composed=SnippetList_asp_112_29 k-parent=2a47f1ee-8053-42fc-a563-758c08673361 k-data=[omitted] k-init k-ready--><div style="" class="aui-primitive __HcW37uIi- __HcWIi-82IiB1 __HcWIi-bS7X-z"><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-expand=snippet_41_21 k-id=6f81348a-d700-4b84-a4a3-c769f6222ce8 k-parent=e980727c-4dfd-4a86-88ef-565df510bca0 k-data=[omitted] k-init--><div style="" class="aui-primitive __HcW37uIi- __HcWIi-82IiB1 __HcWIi-bS7X-z __P0nNOOvpt01x"><div data-csa-c-type="uxElement" data-csa-c-item-id="cr-product-insights-detail-page_read-more-link" data-csa-c-pos="" data-csa-c-posx="" data-csa-c-posy="" data-csa-c-owner="CustomerReviews" data-csa-c-item-type="" data-csa-c-parent-element-id="" class="aui-primitive" data-csa-c-slot-id="cr-product-insights-detail-page_read-more-link" data-csa-c-id="up983h-5d0va2-h4a3vh-1d4f36"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" aria-hidden="true" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">"</span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">...Installation was easy. Good quality but the </span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ __SARCET4AB">spike tips need to be sharper</span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">. Some smart pigeons have found a way to sit on the spikes too!...</span></span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" aria-hidden="true" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">"</span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" aria-hidden="true" class="aui-primitive"> </span><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-component=TextLink-CW5gFkCpvCIYQQ2 k-id=4008bd41-c2c0-49f1-acea-487c85db0313 k-data=[omitted] k-init k-ready--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-var-addr=/MainView_summar_114_5/aspectClickEven_571_13/useCasesTreatme_481_21/BottomSheetCont_429_25/aspect_79_22/6/SnippetList_asp_112_29/snippet_41_21/0/TextLinkTemplat_67_25/mouseHover_37_11 k-expand-let=mouseHover_37_11 k-parent=4008bd41-c2c0-49f1-acea-487c85db0313 k-data=[omitted] k-init--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-expand-let=hoverStyles_62_5 k-parent=4008bd41-c2c0-49f1-acea-487c85db0313 k-data=[omitted] k-init--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-component=TextLink-ankhSKrqAwy000u k-id=40104bd9-3957-4ebd-b586-cc33ed8bb16f k-composed=TextLinkPrimiti_111_1 k-parent=4008bd41-c2c0-49f1-acea-487c85db0313 k-data=[omitted] k-init k-ready--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-expand-let=shouldStopPropa_50_5 k-parent=40104bd9-3957-4ebd-b586-cc33ed8bb16f k-data=[omitted] k-init--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-expand-let=targetStr_58_5 k-parent=40104bd9-3957-4ebd-b586-cc33ed8bb16f k-data=[omitted] k-init--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-var-addr=/MainView_summar_114_5/aspectClickEven_571_13/useCasesTreatme_481_21/BottomSheetCont_429_25/aspect_79_22/6/SnippetList_asp_112_29/snippet_41_21/0/TextLinkTemplat_67_25/TextLinkPrimiti_111_1/pressed_60_11 k-expand-let=pressed_60_11 k-parent=40104bd9-3957-4ebd-b586-cc33ed8bb16f k-data=[omitted] k-init--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-expand-let=hrefStr_83_5 k-parent=40104bd9-3957-4ebd-b586-cc33ed8bb16f k-data=[omitted] k-init