p" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.in/portal/customer-reviews/B01N0LJWHA/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_fmt?_encoding=UTF8&amp;formatType=current_format"><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Size: Bird Spikes 10 Pcs<i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i></span><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Colour: Black</span></a><i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i><span class="_Y3Itd_inline-contributor_33jDb"><div data-hook="review-badges" class="_Y3Itd_review-badges_yvEgM"><a class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.in/gp/help/customer/display.html/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_avp?ie=UTF8&amp;nodeId=G8UYX7LALQC8V9KA"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></a></div></span></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-5"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-5-teaser-describedby-collapsed">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-5-teaser-describedby-expanded">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R10HEZ7TUI6IZP_3_review_text" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="basic" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-5-card0" data-csa-c-id="vlb85j-jc09fz-jytemg-nsxwur"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container a-reactive-container-transition" style="height: 80px;"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="300" style="max-height:300px"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-IN" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>Very useful product for keeping pigeons away from balcony and AC outdoor unit. The spikes are sturdy, good quality polycarbonate, and easy to install. After installing, pigeon disturbance reduced a lot and the area stays much cleaner now. Size and design fit well on window ledges and AC units. Good value for money with 10 pieces in the pack. Recommended for anyone facing bird issues at home or office.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R10HEZ7TUI6IZP_3_show_more" data-csa-c-type="element" data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha a-hidden" data-csa-c-id="1unwwy-uarejs-mar1k5-uhqmq3"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click" data-csa-c-id="5cvctx-gmq0cw-lm4vyr-lsdx8b"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon a-css-icon-draw a-css-icon-expand"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text" style="">Read more</span><span class="a-see-less-text" style="display:none">Read less</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="translationSpinner" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2" style="display: none !important;"><div class="a-spinner-wrapper _Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner_1tBUJ"><span class="a-spinner a-spinner-medium"></span></div></div></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-top-small _Y3Itd_helpful-votes-container_3iphI"><span data-hook="helpful-vote-statement" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">4 people found this helpful</span></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-small a-spacing-top-small"><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-vote-action-bar_10AyR"><div data-hook="helpfulVoteWidget" class="a-section a-spacing-none _Y3It