                                <div class="a-popover-preload" id="a-popover-pqvOverlay">             <div data-cel-widget="pqv-dpx-widget-desktop" data-csa-c-content-id="pqv-dpx-widget-desktop" data-csa-c-slot-id="pqv-dpx-widget-desktop" data-csa-c-type="popup" class="a-section a-padding-none celwidget" data-csa-c-id="6ybwq8-eepx9f-tw32nq-xq3nxg">      <script type="text/javascript">(function(f) {var _np=(window.P._namespace("DetailPagePQVAssets"));if(_np.guardFatal){_np.guardFatal(f)(_np);}else{f(_np);}}(function(P) {
                P.now('pqv').execute(function(pqv) {
                    if (!pqv) {
                        P.register("pqv", function () {
                            return {
                                overlayType: 'desktop'
                            };
                        });
                    }
                });
            }));</script>         <h1 id="pqv-title"> Product Summary: SpikeZone - Bird Spikes - Pigeon Control Spikes (Bird Spikes 7 Pcs, Transparent) </h1>    <p id="pqv-byline">From SpikeZone</p>               <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium">  <p id="pqv-ratings" data-target="#averageCustomerReviews_feature_div" class="a-spacing-none">  4.2 out of 5 stars, 3,124 ratings </p> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-reviews-action" data-pqv-reviews-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-reviews" data-target="#customer-reviews_feature_div" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.in/SpikeZone-Spikes-Pigeon-Control-Transparent/dp/B0CY51FWWP/ref=asc_df_B0CY51FWWP?ref=dp_product_quick_view#customer-reviews_feature_div"> Customer reviews </a> </span>   </div>        <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-price"> Price </h2>             <p class="a-spacing-small">              <span class="a-text-bold"> One-time purchase: ₹260.00 </span>         ( ₹37.14 / piece)          19% Savings   </p>         <p id="pqv-price-list-price" data-target="#corePriceDisplay_desktop_feature_div .basisPrice" class="a-spacing-small"> List Price: <span class="a-text-strike"> ₹320.00 </span> </p>                                              <p id="pqv-price-vat-message" class="a-spacing-small">  Inclusive of all taxes  </p>           <p class="a-text-italic"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-buybox-action" data-pqv-buybox-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-buybox" data-target="#buybox" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.in/SpikeZone-Spikes-Pigeon-Control-Transparent/dp/B0CY51FWWP/ref=asc_df_B0CY51FWWP?ref=dp_product_quick_view#buybox"> Purchasing options </a> </span> </p>                <p class="a-text-italic"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-buying-options-action" data-pqv-buying-options-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-buying-options" data-target="#dynamic-aod-ingress-box" class="a-link-normal aok-hidden" href="https://www.amazon.in/SpikeZone-Spikes-Pigeon-Control-Transparent/dp/B0CY51FWWP/ref=asc_df_B0CY51FWWP?ref=dp_product_quick_view#dynamic-aod-ingress-box"> Other sellers </a> </span> </p> <p class="a-text-italic"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-unqualified-buybox-action" data-pqv-unqualified-buybox-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-unqualified-buybox" data-target="#unqualifiedBuyBox" class="a-link-normal aok-hidden" href="https://www.amazon.in/SpikeZone-Spikes-Pigeon-Control-Transparent/dp/B0CY51FWWP/ref=asc_df_B0CY51FWWP?ref=dp_product_quick_view#unqualifiedBuyBox"> Other sellers </a> </span> </p>  </div>         <div id="pqv-feature-bullets" data-target="#featurebullets_feature_div" class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-feature-bullets-heading">About this Item</h2> <ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical">  <li><span class="a-list-item">Bird Spike : 305 mm length, Height 95 mm, width 120 mm</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Protect your AC, Ledges, Window Sil, Balcony Area, Warehouse, Factory, Office and Premises with Bird Control Spike</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Easy to install: They are easy to install and can be easily fixed to the top or edge of fence or climb mesh with cable ties, adhesive, nails, or screws.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Premium materials: The bird spikes are made of polypropylene plastic, which is lightweight. It can also resist changing weather conditions and long-term UV radiation and is not prone to aging, decomposition, rusting, and is very durable, making it ideal for fence tops in the garden use.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Humanized Design: Plastic bird spike is a humane bird control and anti cat climb option because they do not harm birds, but rather discourage them from landing on surfaces where the spikes are installed.</span></li>  </ul> </div>           <div id="pqv-description" data-target="#productDescription_feature_div" class="a-section a-spacing-medium">  <h2 id="pqv-description-heading">Product description</h2>    <div>
                    Birds spikes are the total solution of bird problems. Use these spikes and get your solution and it is also very necessary to maintain health and hygiene around you. Spikes are easily installed with glue, or may also be applied with nails, screws, tie-downs, or other method to attach to desired areas. No maintenance is generally required. It is Ideal for use on ledges, beams, rafters, railings, window air conditioners, signs, windowsills, gutters, roof perimeters, awnings, support structures, chimneys, signs, lights, poles, trusses, building projects, in some situations statues or anywhere birds like to land, nest, or roost. These Polycarbonate spikes are ideal for use with medium-sized birds such as pigeons, grackles, starlings, crows, and blackbirds, and also make spaces unappealing for seagulls and gulls, sparrows, swallows, bats, some climbing animals, and more.  </div>
               </div>                        <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-options-available">Options Available</h2>    <h3>Size</h3> <ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical">  <li><span class="a-list-item"> Bird Spikes 5 Pcs </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> Bird Spikes 7 Pcs </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> Bird Spikes 10 Pcs </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> Bird Spikes 20 Pcs </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> Bird Spikes 30 Pcs </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> Bird Spikes 40 Pcs </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> Bird Spikes 50 Pcs </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> Bird Spikes 60 Pcs </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> Bird Spikes 70 Pcs </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> Bird Spikes 80 Pcs </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> Bird Spikes 90 Pcs </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> Bird Spikes 100 Pcs </span></li>  </ul>  <h3>Colour</h3> <ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical">  <li><span class="a-list-item"> Black </span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item"> Transparent </span></li>  </ul>  <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-twister-action" data-pqv-twister-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-twister" data-target="#twister-plus-inline-twister,#twister" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.in/SpikeZone-Spikes-Pigeon-Control-Transparent/dp/B0CY51FWWP/ref=asc_df_B0CY51FWWP?ref=dp_product_quick_view#twister"> Browse all available options </a> </span> </div>                              <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-report-issue-action" data-pqv-report-issue-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-report-issue" data-target="#tellAmazon_feature_div" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.in/SpikeZone-Spikes-Pigeon-Control-Transparent/dp/B0CY51FWWP/ref=asc_df_B0CY51FWWP?ref=dp_product_quick_view#tellAmazon_feature_div"> Report an issue with this product or seller </a> </span> </div>                     <div id="pqv-feedback" class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-feedback-heading">Feedback</h2> <p>Did you find this product summary feature useful?</p>   <div id="pqv-feedback-buttons-section" class="a-section"> <div class="a-section a-padding-base aok-float-left"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-feedback-positive-action" data-pqv-feedback-positive-action="{}"> <span id="pqv-feedback-positive" class="a-button a-button-base"><span class="a-button-inner"><input id="pqv-feedback-positive-native" aria-described-by="Submit feedback that this product summary is useful" class="a-button-input" type="submit" aria-labelledby="pqv-feedback-positive-announce"><span id="pqv-feedback-positive-announce" class="a-button-text" aria-hidden="true"> Yes, it is useful </span></span></span> </span> </div> <div class="a-section a-padding-base"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-feedback-negative-action" data-pqv-feedback-negative-action="{}"> <span id="pqv-feedback-negative" class="a-button a-button-base"><span class="a-button-inner"><input id="pqv-feedback-negative-native" aria-described-by="Submit feedback that this product summary isn't useful" class="a-button-input" type="submit" aria-labelledby="pqv-feedback-negative-announce"><span id="pqv-feedback-negative-announce" class="a-button-text" aria-hidden="true"> No, it is not useful </span></span></span> </span> </div> </div> <div id="pqv-feedback-submit-section" class="a-section aok-hidden"> <div class="a-section a-padding-base aok-float-left"> <div class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-success aok-hidden" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><div class="a-box-inner a-alert-container"><i class="a-icon a-icon-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="a-alert-content" tabindex="-1"> Thank you for your feedback </div></div></div> <div id="pqv-feedback-message-positive" class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-success aok-hidden" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><div class